  "details": "If possible, I think it would be a good idea to have the option to hide specific worlds we can choose so it doesn't have to pop up in friends playing / the world pages. Not only just a filter to filter out certain keywords/tags of worlds, but the ability to also block whatever specific world you don't want to see from showing up at all!\n\nI personally don't have problems for worlds I'm seeing while scrolling down, but there are people who feel really uncomfortable seeing certain worlds even scrolling through them, such as inappropriate worlds that people feel uncomfortable with seeing, or worlds that can bring bad memories to those—and I think that this feature can help players feel a bit more comfortable on VRChat! :)\n\nThis might be more of a small feature but can be really helpful for those that need to hides/block certain worlds or/and tags so they don't have to see them c:",
